'==================================================================================
' SECTION: COMPONENT DIAGRAM
' FILE: 02_Component_ArsitekturTeknis_v5.puml
' JUDUL: Diagram Arsitektur Teknis
' SUMBER: TDD SID Desa Cibenda v5.0 (Section 5.2.1, 5.2.3, 5.4.2)
'         + SID-ARCH-BE-001 v1.0 (S1 Tech Stack, S2 Pola Arsitektur,
'           S3 Pipeline Dinamis, S7 Notifikasi & Event)
' CATATAN: Menggantikan 5.2.2_v4 (Diagram Arsitektur Teknis, v4.2). Layer
'          dasar (Client/API/Data/External) TIDAK berubah strukturnya -
'          perubahan ada di ISI komponen Business Layer (pipeline dinamis
'          menggantikan hardcode per-role) dan Async Layer (event generik).
'==================================================================================

@startuml 5.2.2_v5 Diagram Arsitektur Teknis
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam rectangle {
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
  BorderColor #2E5FA3
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #EBF3FB
  BorderColor #2E5FA3
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #D5F5E3
  BorderColor #1E8449
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 12
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor #FEF9E7
  BorderColor #F39C12
  FontName Arial
}
skinparam arrow {
  Color #2E5FA3
  FontName Arial
  FontSize 11
}

title Diagram Arsitektur Teknis - SID Desa Cibenda (v5.0)

rectangle "CLIENT LAYER" #EBF3FB {
  [Browser\n(Warga / RT / RW / Kasi / Kaur /\nPetugas Desa / Kepala Desa /\nSekretaris Desa)] as CLIENT
  rectangle "React SPA (Vite)" #D6E4F7 {
    [Pages & Components\n(Feature-Based: /surat,\n/kependudukan, /cms,\n/admin-config)] as PAGES
    [ApprovalStepRenderer\n(Komponen Generik)] as ASR
    [Services (Axios /\nTanStack Query)] as AXIOS
    [Auth Context\n(HttpOnly Cookie)] as AUTH
  }
}

note right of ASR
  BARU v5.0 (SID-ARCH-FE-001 S6).
  Komponen generik TUNGGAL yang
  merender tombol approve/reject
  berdasarkan approver_position +
  is_final dari API - TIDAK ADA
  komponen terpisah per role
  (RTApprovalCard/KadesApprovalCard/
  dst DIHAPUS). Untuk RW, TIDAK
  PERNAH merender aksi apapun.
end note

rectangle "API LAYER  -  Laravel REST API" #D5EAD0 {
  rectangle "HTTP Layer" #C8E6C9 {
    [Middleware\n(Sanctum Auth, RBAC Custom,\nThrottle)] as MW
    [Controllers\n(RtApprovalController,\nFlowStepApprovalController*,\ndst)] as CTRL
    [Form Requests\n(Validation)] as FREQ
    [API Resources] as ARES
  }
  rectangle "Business Layer" #A5D6A7 {
    [Services\n(LetterService, OfficialService,\nAuthService, PdfService,\nFamilyService*)] as SVC
    [Repositories\n(LetterRepository, UserRepository,\nOfficialRepository, ApprovalFlowRepository*,\nFamilyRepository*, ...)] as REPO
    [Policies\n(Authorization,\nLetterPolicy::decide())] as POL
  }
  rectangle "Async Layer" #81C784 {
    [Events &\nListeners\n(FlowStepAdvanced*\n- generik)] as EVT
    [Jobs / Queue\nWorker] as QUEUE
    [Notifications] as NOTIF
    [Scheduler] as SCHED
  }
  rectangle "Dokumen & Import" #B2DFDB {
    [PDF Generator\n(barryvdh/laravel-dompdf)\nOn-Demand] as PDFGEN
    [Excel Importer\n(maatwebsite/excel)] as EXCEL
  }
}

note right of CTRL
  * FlowStepApprovalController BARU v5.0 -
  menggantikan RwApprovalController (DIHAPUS)
  dan KadusApprovalController (DIHAPUS).
  Satu controller generik melayani
  Kepala Desa/Sekdes/Kasi/Kaur sekaligus.
  RtApprovalController TETAP TERPISAH
  (basis wilayah, bukan posisi murni).
end note

note right of SVC
  LetterService: processStepDecision()
  generik menggantikan
  processRwDecision/processKadusDecision/
  processKasiDecision (v4.2, DIHAPUS).
  OfficialService: resolveByPositionOnly()
  BARU untuk Kades/Sekdes/Kasi/Kaur;
  resolveKadusForCitizen() DIHAPUS;
  resolveRwForCitizen() turun level jadi
  notifier saja (SID-ARCH-BE-001 S3.2).
  * FamilyService BARU - kelola KK.
end note

note right of REPO
  LetterRepository: findByFlowStepAndStatus()
  generik menggantikan findByRwIdAndStatus/
  findByHamletIdAndStatus/
  findByAssignedRoleAndStatus (v4.2,
  SEMUA DIHAPUS) - dipakai lintas Service
  (dashboard, notifikasi, scheduler).
  * ApprovalFlowRepository, FamilyRepository,
  LetterCategoryRepository: BARU v5.0.
end note

note right of EVT
  *** PERUBAHAN v5.0 (SID-ARCH-BE-001 S7) ***
  FlowStepAdvanced: Event GENERIK, dipicu
  SETIAP kali current_step_order berpindah -
  MENGGANTIKAN Event spesifik per posisi
  (RtApproved/RwApproved/dst - v4.2, DIHAPUS).
  Satu Listener generik resolve approver
  berikutnya via OfficialService, PLUS
  memicu notifikasi FYI ke RW secara
  paralel/non-blocking jika step
  sebelumnya = RT.
end note

rectangle "DATA LAYER" #FDE8D8 {
  database "PostgreSQL 16" as DB {
    [letters (status generik,\nflow_id, current_step_order,\nrejected_at_step)\nletter_approvals, letter_status_logs\nletter_types, letter_categories*\napproval_flows*, flow_steps*\nusers, citizens (+ 11 kolom baru),\nfamilies*, citizen_socioeconomics*\nofficials, hamlets, rws, rts\napproval_settings\nvillage_org_positions/members\nnotifications, news\nvillage_regulations, villages] as TABLES
  }
  [Eloquent ORM\n+ Migrations] as ORM
}

note bottom of TABLES
  * Tabel/kolom BARU v5.0: letter_categories,
  approval_flows, flow_steps, families,
  citizen_socioeconomics, + kolom baru di
  citizens (family_id, father_id, mother_id,
  residency_type, dst - lihat TDD 5.4.2).
  Kolom no_kk DIHAPUS dari citizens (pindah
  ke families.no_kk).
  letter_hashes, village_assets,
  village_finances, letter_type_fields,
  letter_field_values TIDAK ADA di MVP
  (Next Dev/Tahap 2) - TIDAK digambar di sini,
  TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2.
end note

cloud "EXTERNAL" #FEF9E7 {
  [Mail Server\n(SMTP)] as MAIL
  [Laravel Telescope\n(Dev Monitoring)] as TEL
}

CLIENT --> PAGES
PAGES --> ASR
PAGES --> AXIOS
AXIOS --> AUTH
AXIOS --> MW : HTTPS + Cookie
MW --> CTRL
CTRL --> FREQ
CTRL --> SVC
SVC --> POL
SVC --> REPO
REPO --> ORM
SVC --> EVT
EVT --> QUEUE
QUEUE --> NOTIF
NOTIF --> MAIL
QUEUE --> REPO
SCHED --> REPO
SCHED --> QUEUE : SendApprovalReminderJob\n(cek deadline_at setiap jam)
ORM --> DB
CTRL --> ARES
ARES --> AXIOS
TEL ..> DB : monitor (dev only)

CTRL --> PDFGEN : trigger saat\nklik Download
PDFGEN --> REPO : ambil data surat\n+ TTD/stempel (officials)
PDFGEN --> CTRL : return binary PDF\n(tidak disimpan)

CTRL --> EXCEL : trigger saat\nImport Data Warga
EXCEL --> REPO : validasi & simpan\nper baris (citizens)

note bottom of SVC
  OfficialService kini punya DUA pola
  resolve yang harus dibedakan eksplisit:
  - BERBASIS WILAYAH (RT): via citizens.rt_id
    -> rts.id, lalu officials aktif dg rt_id sama
  - BERBASIS POSISI MURNI (Kepala Desa, Sekdes,
    Kasi/Kaur): via officials.position IN (...)
    + is_active=true, TANPA join wilayah
    sama sekali (SID-ARCH-BE-001 S3.2)
end note

note bottom of PDFGEN
  Generate PDF ON-DEMAND saat tombol
  download diklik. Tidak ada kolom path
  PDF di tabel letters, tidak ada file
  tersimpan di server. TIDAK BERUBAH
  dari v4.0.
end note

note bottom of QUEUE
  Queue driver: database (Tahap 1).
  Job yang berjalan: SendNotificationJob
  (generik, menerima approverPosition),
  SendApprovalReminderJob.
  TIDAK ADA GenerateLetterHashJob
  (blockchain hashing = Next Dev, belum
  diimplementasikan di MVP).
  TIDAK BERUBAH dari v4.2.
end note

@enduml

'==================================================================================
' CATATAN REVISI: 5.2.2_v4 (Diagram Arsitektur Teknis v4.2) -> 02_Component_ArsitekturTeknis_v5.puml
'==================================================================================
'
' LAYER DASAR TIDAK BERUBAH: Client Layer (React SPA) -> API Layer
'   (HTTP/Business/Async/Dokumen) -> Data Layer (PostgreSQL) -> External
'   (Mail Server, Telescope). Struktur besar 4-layer ini identik dengan v4.2.
'
' PERUBAHAN ISI KOMPONEN:
'   1. Client Layer: TAMBAH komponen "ApprovalStepRenderer" (BARU v5.0,
'      SID-ARCH-FE-001 S6) - komponen generik pengganti kartu approval
'      per-role yang di v4.2 tersirat ada tapi tidak digambar eksplisit.
'   2. HTTP Layer: Controllers kini merujuk FlowStepApprovalController
'      (BARU, generik) menggantikan RwApprovalController+
'      KadusApprovalController (DIHAPUS) sebagai representasi - dicatat
'      via note, bukan komponen box terpisah (mengikuti gaya diagram asli
'      yang meringkas Controllers jadi satu box).
'   3. Business Layer: Services & Repositories diberi catatan (note)
'      eksplisit tentang method yang dihapus/diganti/ditambah - mengikuti
'      detail yang sudah dirinci di Class Diagram Core v5, versi ringkas
'      untuk level component diagram ini.
'   4. Async Layer: Events & Listeners diberi label "(FlowStepAdvanced -
'      generik)" dan catatan tentang perubahan filosofi Event generik
'      menggantikan Event granular per posisi (SID-ARCH-BE-001 S7).
'   5. Data Layer: daftar tabel di dalam box PostgreSQL diperbarui -
'      tambah letter_categories, approval_flows, flow_steps, families,
'      citizen_socioeconomics; kolom citizens diberi catatan perubahan
'      (+11 kolom baru, no_kk dihapus); letters diberi catatan kolom baru
'      (flow_id, current_step_order, rejected_at_step).
'   6. Note di bawah SVC (OfficialService dua pola resolve) DIPERBARUI
'      untuk secara eksplisit membedakan resolve berbasis wilayah vs
'      berbasis posisi murni - di v4.2 catatan ini hanya menyebutkan
'      "resolve via rt_id/rw_id/hamlet_id", sekarang perlu penjelasan
'      lebih tajam karena ada 2 POLA BERBEDA yang harus dibedakan
'      eksplisit di kode (bukan sekadar 3 kolom FK yang mirip).
'
' YANG TETAP SAMA:
'   - Middleware, Form Requests, API Resources, PDF Generator, Excel
'     Importer, Scheduler: struktur dan alur panah TIDAK berubah.
'   - Catatan "TIDAK ADA GenerateLetterHashJob" (blockchain masih Next
'     Dev) tetap dipertahankan apa adanya.
'   - Auth Context (HttpOnly Cookie), Laravel Sanctum, Laravel Telescope:
'     tidak berubah.
'
'==================================================================================
